# PR from firing a "review requested... as a code owner" notification
# (confirmed: ~30 such emails from one week's Dependabot wave, 2026-08-12),
# without touching branch protection (require_code_owner_reviews is
# already false, so this changes notification volume only, not any
# enforced gate). Deliberate trade-off: a human PR touching only these
# exact paths also won't request review -- acceptable today with one
# active reviewer; revisit once there's a second one and human dependency
# PRs are common enough to want that signal back.
